 # MalGuard / GTA Guard
+
+Desktop 1.3.0 / engine 1.2.0 source candidate adds byte-based file explanations,
+real stage progress, an evidence gauge and a downloadable bilingual report card.
+See [desktop inspection and validation](docs/DESKTOP_INSPECTION.md). A new Windows
+installer has not yet been published.
 
 Clean-room, offline static analysis for GTA V mod files and packages, with a Python 3.12 library and Persian command-line reports. Scanned content is never executed, imported, compiled, loaded as a DLL or assembly, or passed to a shell. The workspace initially contained no engine, repository or legacy tests; no previous MalGuard implementation was used.
 
